name 'building-data-driven-systems-preassessment-q8_2025'

question 'An AI generates a dataset of "Doctors" that only includes male names and photos. This is an example of:'

wrong 'Algorithmic efficiency'
wrong 'Data schema optimization'
right 'Training data bias'
wrong 'A rendering error in the DOM'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 4

If an AI is trained on data that lacks diversity or reflects societal stereotypes, its output will reinforce those biases, such as associating a specific profession with only one gender.
MARKDOWN
